# 🧩 **Tri‑Stream Schema Definition (v1.0)**  
**This is the formal machine‑readable schema.**

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Spectral Labyrinth Tri-Stream Envelope",
  "type": "object",

  "properties": {
    "ic_stream": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "In-character narrative stream",
      "properties": {
        "altitude": { "type": "string", "const": "A6" },
        "membrane": { "type": "string", "const": "narrative" },
        "payload": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "required": ["altitude", "membrane", "payload"]
    },

    "dev_stream": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Developer diagnostic stream",
      "properties": {
        "altitude": { "type": "string", "const": "A6-dev" },
        "membrane": { "type": "string", "const": "diagnostic" },
        "payload": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "required": ["altitude", "membrane", "payload"]
    },

    "meta_stream": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Meta interpretive analysis stream",
      "properties": {
        "altitude": { "type": "string", "const": "A6-meta" },
        "membrane": { "type": "string", "const": "interpretive" },
        "payload": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "required": ["altitude", "membrane", "payload"]
    },

    "routing": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Rules governing membrane separation and channel behavior",
      "properties": {
        "rules": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "required": ["rules"]
    },

    "provenance": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Metadata for auditability and governance",
      "properties": {
        "timestamp": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
        "maintainer": { "type": "string" },
        "compiler": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "required": ["timestamp", "maintainer", "compiler"]
    }
  },

  "required": [
    "ic_stream",
    "dev_stream",
    "meta_stream",
    "routing",
    "provenance"
  ]
}
```

---

# 🧠 **Why This Schema Works**

This schema is:

- **Machine‑readable** — strict JSON Schema  
- **Altitude‑bounded** — A6, A6‑dev, A6‑meta  
- **Membrane‑sealed** — narrative, diagnostic, interpretive  
- **Non‑activating** — no NDH geometry, no adjacency engines  
- **Governance‑aligned** — matches Shared‑Horizon artifact patterns  
- **Extensible** — can support future layers (A7‑reflective, A8‑adjacent)  
- **Deterministic** — predictable routing and parsing  
- **Replayable** — every tri‑stream output is auditable  

This is the **foundation** of your harness.

